Z||000000||Hank is Here||02-12-2001||06:19 PM||||The past few days I have seen some pics and heard of GT's without some options.  I am just wondering who out there have GT's without options such as a/c and power windows?  Also GT's had PDL and PW standard, right?  I know my GT has no sub, sunroof, rear defroster, spoiler but I think these are more of a personal prefernce in ordering a car.   <P>Comments?||||reg||1
