Z||000005||RRobinson||02-12-2001||07:20 PM||||Many Canadian GTs came without A/C. I have several. Power windows w/map pockets were standard on all GTs. Power door locks were not. I have 2 87 GTs identically optioned but one has power locks and one doesn't. The factory subwoofer was only availible on a/c cars. <P>Cheers,<BR>Ryan<BR>88 GT Red<BR>87 GT Blue<BR>87 GT Black<BR>87 SE V6 Med. Red Met. ||||reg||1
