Z||000011||mrfiero||02-12-2001||08:30 PM||||I bought an '88 GT parts car 2 years ago (wrapped around a tree).  It had no AC, power locks or power mirrors.  It was pretty much a stripped down model with the exception of the drivers side power lumbar seat option......very strange.<P>Most '88 GT's came with the 1SA option group, which included the power locks & mirrors, but a few were ordered without this grouping to get someone into a GT for the least amount of $$ (how's that for a run-on sentence)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   <BR>||||reg||1
