Z||000014||Standard||02-12-2001||10:23 PM||||Well, I'm not sure what GT's came with if they were ordered w/o any extra options, but I'm pretty sure that PW and power trunk were standard.  My GT has PW, PM, PL, power trunk, r. defrost, AC, wing(well, it used to...).. everything but the leather seats and performance sound, I think.  Also one of roughly 2,000 86 GT's with the 5 speed  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  maybe not the rarest thing in the world, but rare enough to make me feel special  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Everybody wants a normal life and a cool car.. <B>Most people settle for the car</B><P>I'm not dumb.  I just have a command of thoroughly useless information<BR>        <BR>AOL: LastMinuteBastrd<BR>AIM: SavedByJebus    -- you'll understand if you watch The Simpsons :D||||reg||1
Z||000015||stimpy||02-12-2001||11:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ronnie:<BR><B>Forgot to mention, also has the factory gray pigskin leather interior.Is this a rare option?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>According to the spotters guide, 2,855 86 Fieros were ordered with leather This equals 3.4% of prodution in 86. Factor in some were<BR>SE's and a leather 86 GT should be pretty rare, especially if the interior is in decent shape.<P>My 86 GT has the leather, gold paint, and a lugage rack. How's that for some options? ||||reg||1
Z||000016||Carrolles||02-13-2001||08:07 AM||||My 85GT is red and has:<P>Power mirrors, power locks, power windows, three spoke leather wheel, leather shift knob, auto, tilt wheel, rear hatch release, am/fm/cassette (no equalizer), luggage rack, trunk light, front compartment light,  mirror on passenger side sun-visor, map pocket in dash, typical aluminum wheels with lug nut caps, typical GT megaphone exhaust tips, typical GT emblem on horn button, cruise, intermittent wipers, A/C.<P>Does not have sunroof, wing, rear defogger.||||reg||1
Z||000017||stsmithgt||02-13-2001||10:37 AM||||Looks like the GT's are listing ops.<P>My 86GT:<BR>pw<BR>pdl<BR>cc<BR>ac<BR>tilt steering<BR> rear window defrost <BR>sun roof<BR>power mirrors<BR>sub woof<BR>power trunk release.?? <BR>I think that's it.?<P>The options I'm missing are leather seats, a stereo with an equilizer, and that optional set cover with pretty eyes and long legs to keep me company.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||7
